Step 6: Understanding Recovery Points

A major focus of the module was recovery points.

Recovery points are snapshots of protected data that can be restored later.

Example:
Monday Backup
Tuesday Backup
Wednesday Backup
Thursday Backup

If data is lost on Thursday:

Restore Wednesday Recovery Point
Benefits:
Point-in-time recovery
Data protection
Flexible restoration options

Recovery points form the foundation of Azure Backup recovery operations.

