Key Takeaway

Azure Backup is Microsoft's cloud-native backup solution that protects Azure and on-premises workloads from data loss, corruption, accidental deletion, and ransomware. By using Recovery Services Vaults, backup policies, recovery points, and secure storage options, Azure Administrators can build reliable backup and recovery strategies that support business continuity and disaster recovery. Understanding Azure Backup, Recovery Services Vaults, backup policies, and restore operations is essential for the AZ-104 exam and real-world Azure administration.
